<SizedBox height="10"/>
<Row crossAxisAlignment="START"><Container width="6" height="6" color="#FCD34D" borderRadius="3" margin="(0,9,10,0)"/><Expanded><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#E2E8F0">8 月退款率 8.00%、经营利润环比 −16.4%；9 月退款率降至 4.00%，利润 ¥64,368 创半年新高。</Text></Expanded></Row>
<Spacer/>
